+### gfx1100 decode switches of this branch (RX 7900 XTX)
+
+Every one keeps the main model's bits (window hashes and emitted argmaxes equal v0.2.9's on the code / prose / edit
+follow texts with `--suffix-draft 0` and a fixed `--expert-cache`). On by default on gfx1100
+(`STRATA_GFX1100_DEFAULTS=0` turns the table off; a switch you set is kept): `STRATA_ROUTE_DPP`, `STRATA_ROUTER_TAIL`,
+`STRATA_GDN_AB_ILP`, `STRATA_FUSE_CONVAB`, `STRATA_MULTI_BLOCK_ARGMAX`, `STRATA_UMWAIT` (Linux), `STRATA_POOL_GUIDED=32`.
+On by default on gfx1100 in the code, each with its `=0`: the pipelined HC down read and the read in one kernel
+(`STRATA_GR_PIPE`, `STRATA_GR_ONE`), the dense GEMVs (`STRATA_MMVQ_G11`, `STRATA_MMVQ_R4`), the draft kernel diet
+(`STRATA_MTP_FUSE`), PR #540's decode attention with the bounded merge (`STRATA_ATTN_PRE75`, `STRATA_ATTN_MERGE_V2`),
+the v2 prompt attention (`STRATA_PA_V2`, with `STRATA_HIP_WMMA=1`). Opt-in (the run config sets them): the launch cuts
+`STRATA_SH_GATE_TAIL`, `STRATA_COMBINE_MAPPED`, `STRATA_QSA_GATE_Q8`, `STRATA_MAPPED_FAST`, `STRATA_T1_FUSE`,
+`STRATA_QSA_FOLD`, `STRATA_ROUTER_TAIL_ROWS=4`; the draft side `STRATA_MTP_NO_RCOPY`, `STRATA_MTP_MIX_FUSED` (moves
+draft probabilities in their last bits), `STRATA_SPEC_CUM` / `STRATA_SPEC_CUM_ACC` (draft stop), `STRATA_MTP_CTX_ROWS`.
+
